  "limitations": [
    "One setup sample per scenario/condition. Probe stores are isolated, but probes share their group's setup provenance and are not independent statistical replications.",
    "Card treatment includes the actual host's policy-dependent readback hint; this is not a storage-only causal ablation.",
    "Fixed execution order, live timestamps, cache warming and generated output differences confound causal cost/latency and accuracy comparisons.",
    "The 11/12 primary semantic score includes one disputed wording case; a stricter interpretation gives 10/12. This is a scoring sensitivity, not a confidence interval.",
    "Empty retrieval did not imply missing visible memory. The failing gallery response had the required fact visible before and after retrieval.",
    "Missing-field probes test fields explicitly marked absent in fixtures, not general abstention over unsearched evidence.",
    "Four verified actual model readbacks cover two card v1 sources. No actual model content-open of v2 was observed; compact projection hashes do not verify original raw bodies.",
    "No actual paid host format/protocol recovery was triggered. The actual-engine offline gates cover these paths separately.",
    "Source/template copies and runtime package versions are recorded; dependency binaries, weights and remote model version are not fully frozen.",
    "Tariff costs are usage estimates and peak budget accounting, not an invoice or provider account balance.",
    "Prior restricted-harness 5/12 and current actual-host results are not comparable as an isolated treatment effect and are not pooled."
